      "id": "Charter Amendment 1",
      "title": "Urban County Council salary",
      "summary": "Would amend the Lexington-Fayette Urban County Government Charter to set Urban County Council members' salary at $59,987 a year, adjusted for the purchasing power of the dollar. The change would take effect for the term beginning January 6, 2031.",
